        return restTemplate.getForObject(url, String.class);
    }

    public String getDefaultStockData() {
        return "Fallback stock data in case of failure.";
    }
}
```

In this example, `HystrixCommand` is used to implement a circuit breaker pattern, which provides fallback behavior and ensures that failures do not cascade. This service communicates with a third-party API using Spring's RestTemplate.

